my-muduo — NOTICE

本项目（my-muduo）是一个学习项目：架构参考 muduo，代码在其基础上改写。

my-muduo is a learning project. Its architecture and API design are based on
muduo (https://github.com/chenshuo/muduo). Parts of the code are rewritten
from muduo and then modified.

